  "solution": {
    "text": "We have <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi></math> is differentiable.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence <math><msup><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>."
